---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/doge.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Burnley Council Spending Over £500 | DOGE | Tom Pickup"
  description="Burnley Borough Council's published spending over £500, by financial year, made searchable. Every payment traceable to the council's own source data."
>
  <div class="doge-page">
    <nav class="doge-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/doge/">DOGE</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <a href="/doge/burnley-council/">Burnley Borough Council</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <span class="here">Spending</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="doge-head">
      <span class="doge-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Spending over £500</span>
      <h1 class="doge-title">Spending over £500</h1>
      <p class="doge-sub">
        Every payment of £500 or more that Burnley Borough Council makes to suppliers and third parties, the
        data it is required to publish under the transparency code. Choose a financial year to search the lot.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="doge-grid">
      <a href="/doge/burnley-council/spending/2025-26/" class="doge-card">
        <span class="doge-card-kicker">Financial year</span>
        <div class="doge-card-title">2025/26</div>
        <div class="doge-card-desc">£38.06m across 4,489 payments to 843 suppliers. April 2025 to March 2026. Searchable, sortable, filterable.</div>
        <span class="doge-card-go">Open →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/doge/burnley-council/spending/2024-25/" class="doge-card">
        <span class="doge-card-kicker">Financial year</span>
        <div class="doge-card-title">2024/25</div>
        <div class="doge-card-desc">£44.10m across 4,096 payments to 799 suppliers. April 2024 to March 2025. Searchable, sortable, filterable.</div>
        <span class="doge-card-go">Open →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/doge/burnley-council/spending/2023-24/" class="doge-card">
        <span class="doge-card-kicker">Financial year</span>
        <div class="doge-card-title">2023/24</div>
        <div class="doge-card-desc">£51.40m across 3,872 payments to 758 suppliers. April 2023 to March 2024. The peak regeneration year.</div>
        <span class="doge-card-go">Open →</span>
      </a>
      <div class="doge-card disabled">
        <span class="doge-card-kicker">Coming soon</span>
        <div class="doge-card-title">2022/23 and earlier</div>
        <div class="doge-card-desc">Back through the council's published record to 2021/22, being added.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
